{"auditVerdictAtHead":"pass","canonicalDigest":"sha256:95fef5800b871f8aacf8e9b5b25b21199548ce8c127cd887cbd3b7dd892801b1","canonicalizationVersion":"1","changeRequest":{"author":"ax1g","body":"Typing in the menu is overwhelmingly an intent to launch, but matching apps sort below menu entries in two situations. This puts apps first in both.\n\n**1. Score tiers (`MenuModel.searchScore`)**\n\nFor `vsc`, the VSCode menu entries match by label prefix (tier 10) while the installed app only matches by keyword substring (tier 40). The existing `-5` app bias only breaks ties, so Setup > Defaults > Editor > VSCode and Install > VSCode both sort above Visual Studio Code. The bias is now `-100`, exceeding every match tier, so any matching app outranks any menu entry. Apps still sort by tier among themselves.\n\n**2. Section order (`Menu.rebuildDisplay`)**\n\nAt the root, direct children render above deeper matches regardless of score, and the Apps submenu itself matches short queries via its `applications` alias — so `c` shows Apps above ChatGPT/cliamp. Matching app rows are now pinned above the direct-children section, with the divider following them.\n\n**Behavior change, stated plainly:** this replaces the previous guarantee that a better-matching menu entry beats a weaker app match (`style.font` vs `apps.fontforge` for `font`). Routing is untouched — exact ids still win and app keywords still never capture routes.\n\n| before | after |\n|---|---|\n| ![vsc before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ax1g/omarchy/pr-assets/menu-apps-first/vsc-before.png) | ![vsc after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ax1g/omarchy/pr-assets/menu-apps-first/vsc-after.png) |\n| ![c before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ax1g/omarchy/pr-assets/menu-apps-first/c-before.png) | ![c after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ax1g/omarchy/pr-assets/menu-apps-first/c-after.png) |\n\n**Verification**\n\n- `test/shell.d/menu-test.sh`: all pass, including a new `vsc` regression test and an updated cross-tier assertion.\n- `menu-guards-test.sh`, `app-search-test.sh`: pass.\n- `qmllint`: no new warnings on the touched file.\n- Verified live on my machine (patched system files + shell restart, screenshots above).","bodyDigest":"sha256:6c55780b6a7435231dbca7ae8e8e001ee4b38d0605b4acb4af0adf0d6eb72807","bodyExcerpt":"Typing in the menu is overwhelmingly an intent to launch, but matching apps sort below menu entries in two situations. This puts apps first in both.","source":"explicit","title":"fix(menu): rank installed apps above menu entries in search"},"createdAt":"2026-10-03T10:36:38Z","decisionSummary":{"claimEvidence":[{"claim":"requirement_preserved","claimId":"requirement:SW-REQ-260922-2JZT","failed":0,"notRun":0,"obligations":[{"class":"error_handling","failed":0,"passed":0,"skipped":0,"source":"inherited:SYS-REQ-260922-47T8","status":"not_linked","tests":0},{"class":"external_call_timeout_bounded","failed":0,"passed":0,"skipped":0,"source":"inherited:SYS-REQ-260922-47T8","status":"not_linked","tests":0}],"passed":2,"requirementId":"SW-REQ-260922-2JZT","status":"observed_pass","unknown":0},{"claim":"requirement_preserved","claimId":"requirement:SW-REQ-260922-3JG5","failed":0,"notRun":0,"obligations":[{"class":"boundary","failed":0,"observedVia":"SYS-REQ-260922-P708","passed":1,"skipped":0,"source":"inherited:SYS-REQ-260922-P708","status":"observed_pass","tests":1}],"passed":2,"requirementId":"SW-REQ-260922-3JG5","status":"observed_pass","unknown":0},{"claim":"requirement_preserved","claimId":"requirement:SW-REQ-260922-3T3F","failed":0,"notRun":0,"obligations":[{"class":"boundary","failed":0,"passed":2,"skipped":0,"source":"own","status":"observed_pass","tests":2},{"class":"error_handling","failed":0,"passed":2,"skipped":0,"source":"own","status":"observed_pass","tests":2},{"class":"input_domain","failed":0,"passed":1,"skipped":0,"source":"own","status":"observed_pass","tests":1}],"passed":3,"requirementId":"SW-REQ-260922-3T3F","status":"observed_pass","unknown":0},